{"content":[{"c":["MIKTAM*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Title in ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.16.1-11","r":"Ps.16.1-11","rawR":"Ps.16.1-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.16.1-11","value":"Ps.16.1-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalms 16"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.56.1-60.12","r":"Ps.56.1-60.12","rawR":"Ps.56.1-60.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.56.1-60.12","value":"Ps.56.1-60.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"56–60"}," (see ",{"c":["niv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), possibly also of Hezekiah’s recovery psalm, ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.38.9","r":"Isa.38.9","rawR":"Isa.38.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.38.9","value":"Isa.38.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Isaiah 38:9"},". The precise meaning of the term is uncertain. Its similarity to the Akkadian word “to cover, expiate” suggests the title may mean a psalm of expiation or sin covered. Other suggestions include a psalm of problems or mysteries."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Music"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Miktam","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Psalms 16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.16.1-11","rawQueryValue":"Ps.16.1-11","sourceRefExact":"Ps.16.1-11"},{"anchorText":"56–60","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.56.1-60.12","rawQueryValue":"Ps.56.1-60.12","sourceRefExact":"Ps.56.1-60.12"},{"anchorText":"Isaiah 38:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.38.9","rawQueryValue":"Isa.38.9","sourceRefExact":"Isa.38.9"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8b57a04ad64fb1a27b2d9a7326f74f772ce2786c3978d18bf18ba3113af0c4b2","sourceI